- flood warnings: 80 (FL.W 43, FA.W 37) against 172, about 2.2 times;
- flood watches: 99 (35 polygon FL.A, 64 zone-coded FA.A) against 608, about 6 times;
- high wind warnings: 536 to 720 against 2544, about 3.5 to 4.7 times;
